WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.889
The experiments span four models covering both
vision and recommendation-style workloads:

00:00:06.969 --> 00:00:09.160
ResNet50 trained on ImageNet,

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:15.816
Vision Transformer and MLP-Mixer fine-tuned on
Cifar10 from ImageNet-21k pretraining,

00:00:15.896 --> 00:00:21.611
and an extreme multi-label classification model on
the Wiki10-31K dataset.

00:00:21.691 --> 00:00:29.677
The testbed is sixteen Nvidia V100 GPUs across two
machines connected by a twenty-five gigabit network,

00:00:29.757 --> 00:00:32.652
running PyTorch with Horovod and NCCL,

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:40.170
and using memory-momentum error feedback to
preserve accuracy across all sparsification methods.
